Lapkiewicz et al., Nature 474, 490 (2011); Reck et al., PRL 73, 58 (1994); \
Clements et al., Optica 3, 1460 (2016) \\[LongDash] the interferometer layer.\
\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"877ce4f4-79f3-7849-84f4-5537f61473d1"],

Cell["\<\
Frustaglia et al., PRL 116, 250404 (2016); Kovtoniuk, Bohmann, Semenov, \
